## Problem classes

### `Cursor global install not loaded`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Skill listed for Claude but missing in Cursor | CLI wrote `~/.agents/skills` and skipped `~/.cursor/skills` | Install with `-a cursor -g`; confirm `ls ~/.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Project install instead of global`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Skills appear only in one repo | `npx skills add` without `-g` writes `./.agents/skills` or `./.claude/skills` | Re-run with `-g`; Superplan is a **global** pack |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `npx add without --list live-installs`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Real `~/.claude` or `~/.cursor` changed during a packaging check | Ran `npx skills add .` without `--list` | Discovery is `npx skills add . --list` only. Keep `npx` out of `make verify` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->
